      "widgets_values": [
        "Vintage analog film photograph. Low-angle Dutch-tilt close-up of a woman posing in front of brightly lit vending machines with her head tilted slightly side way She has short, wavy dark hair and a bold makeup look with deep red lipstick, complemented by large gold drop earrings. Her outfit consists of a textured, pale yellow double-breasted blazer with gold buttons and a vibrant orange ruffled neck scarf. The lighting is soft and hazy with a distinct cyan-green tint, creating a dreamy, retro aesthetic. The background vending machines are filled with colorful snacks, appearing slightly out of focus to emphasize the subject. The composition is slightly tilted, contributing to a dynamic, high-fashion, and nostalgic mood with a cinematic, lo-fi quality."
